# Placement list. Coordinates are world pixels.
# +X right, +Y up, +Z out of the ground. The ground is the z = 0 plane.
# The metric grid on that plane is on from boot. It is not a record.
# Each cube line places one fillet. This one sits 100 world pixels
# to the right of the origin. Another cube line places another fillet.

ground z
cube 100 0 0
cube 1000 0 0
cube -1000 0 0
